// @no-instantiate
// MISCOMPILE, pinned: a MAP whose VALUE type is a union ARM (`{[string]: Circle}`), handed
// to a HAND-WRITTEN GENERIC. Twelve lines, no import, no lambda, no list. `vl check` exits 0
// with NO diagnostics at all and is the ONLY command that misses it; `vl check --codegen`
// exits 1, `vl build` writes the `.wasm` and exits 1, `vl run` exits 1:
//
//   the emitted module is not valid wasm … type mismatch:
//   expected (ref $type), found (ref $type)
//
// (No byte offset quoted on purpose: it moves with the seed — 1234 on `933e2cbf`, 1236
//  here. The message is the stable identifier, and the two `$type`s are two DIFFERENT heap
//  types behind one placeholder.)
//
// THE GENERIC HOP IS THE AXIS, AND IT IS THE ONLY ONE — all three of the controls that
// separate the neighbouring rows are INERT here, which is what says this is its own root:
//
//   delete `idg` and call `thru(c)` directly     RUNS          <- the axis
//   delete `type Dot` (the layout twin)          still silent  <- NOT the twin family
//   annotate the local `: {[string]: Circle}`    still silent  <- NOT D87's channel
//
// So it is neither D75/D82 (a pin resolved onto a twin's `sNames` row — no twin is needed
// here) nor D87 (an un-annotated map local that never saw its destination's annotation —
// annotating it does not help). What is left is the MONOMORPHIZER meeting an ARM-VALUED
// MAP: `monoArgTyName`'s map arm names the argument by its `{[K]: V}` spelling, and the
// instance it mints does not agree with the caller about the value's heap type.
//
// PRE-EXISTING on `933e2cbf`, same sentence — not a regression from the change this file
// ships with. It is 20 of the 96 cells of `silent-class-inventory.md` D87's family that
// that row's fix does not reach, and it is filed as D88.
//
// IT IS THE SPECIMEN. This file is kept byte-for-byte identical to
// `tests/vl_check_codegen_test.ts`'s `INVALID_MODULE_SRC` below its header, which needs a
// program that type-checks clean and whose module the engine refuses.
//
// WHEN IT IS FIXED this file starts failing (the module instantiates), which is the point:
// delete it, graduate a `@run` row, and swap `INVALID_MODULE_SRC` for another live member of
// the class. READ THE NOTE IN `tests/vl_check_codegen_test.ts` BEFORE DOING THAT — including
// what it says about where to look before concluding the class is empty, and the sixth
// source it now carries: re-grade an EARLIER change's grid against today's master.
type Circle = { r: i32 }
type Sq = { s: i32 }
type Shape = Circle | Sq
type Dot = { r: i32 }
function idg<T>(x: T): T { return x }
function thru(x: {[string]: Circle}) { return x }
function mk(n: i32) {
  const c = Map()
  c["k"] = { r: n }
  return idg(thru(c))
}
print(idg(((mk(7))["k"] ?? { r: 0 }).r))
